n":"no","path_reachable":"na","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"yes"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"low","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"low","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"low","prod_impact":"none","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"self_revealing","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"low"}}},{"block_threshold":0.95,"blocking_enabled":false,"checklist_item":"- [ ] State whether the CREATE/EDIT timeline replay is factored out of (or shared with) mine_outcome_corpus.py's `_description_timeline`, or justify a parallel implementation given corpus.py's richer PlanContext needs (file_impact/children/file_impact_scope).","cohort":["A1"],"criteria":["A1"],"decision":"dropped","decision_margin":-0.95,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["mine_outcome_corpus.py:285-304 `_description_timeline` already replays CREATE (`data.description`) + EDIT (`data.fields['description']`) oldest-first to reconstruct description state","Plan reuses that harness explicitly but scopes the reuse to 'git-history-deleted-blob enumeration', leaving the CREATE/EDIT replay reconstruction unscoped","corpus.py needs a fuller PlanContext (file_impact + children + file_impact_scope) than mine's description-only timeline, so partial extension is legitimate — the concern is only whether the shared walk is factored vs duplicated"],"finding":"The plan reuses mine_outcome_corpus.py only for git-blob ENUMERATION, but the per-sidecar CREATE/EDIT timeline replay (to reconstruct description/file_impact/children at the review timestamp) is a second implementation of event-timeline replay that mine_outcome_corpus.py already does for description (`_description_timeline`, replaying CREATE + EDIT `data.fields`). The plan does not state whether the shared timeline walk is factored or re-implemented.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f699ced5666bc37b3","impact":0.0,"is_primary":null,"location":"Approach step 1-2 ('reuse the exact incantation ... git-history-deleted-blob enumeration'; 'replay CREATE/EDIT ... up to the sidecar timestamp')","norm_id":"nbe859c8024f70056","priority":0.0,"reason":"low-validity","recalled":false,"scenarios":["A future fix to EDIT-fields parsing (e.g. a new field shape) has to be applied in two harnesses","The two harnesses drift on how a CREATE with no description or a malformed EDIT is handled"],"severity":"none","suggested_fix":"","tier":"LLM","validity":0.4286,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"na","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"na","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"no","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"yes","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"na","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"no","severity_claim_justified":"yes"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"low","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"low","prod_impact":"none","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"none"}}},{"block_threshold":0.8,"blocking_enabled":true,"checklist_item":"- [ ] Correct Approach step 2 to reconstruct file_impact / file_impact_scope / no_file_impact_reason by replaying `FILE_IMPACT` events (mirroring reducer `process_file_impact` / `_file_impact_scope`) up to the sidecar timestamp — not from CREATE/EDIT `fields`, which never carry these keys.","cohort":["G6"],"criteria":["G6"],"decision":"dropped","decision_margin":-0.8,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["Plan step 2: 'replay `CREATE`/`EDIT` (tree + history-deleted) up to the sidecar timestamp for description and file_impact, resolve child pins ... and rebuild a full `PlanContext` (carrying `file_impact_scope` / `no_file_impact_reason` ...)'","rebar._commands.leaf.set_file_impact appends a dedicated `FILE_IMPACT` event carrying `file_impact` + (`file_impact_scope`,`no_file_impact_reason`) — never an EDIT","rebar.reducer._processors.process_file_impact / _file_impact_scope derive the tri-state ONLY from FILE_IMPACT event data; EDIT.fields never sets these keys","material_diff.material_basis:143 keys file_impact off ctx.state['file_impact'] and adds the file_impact_scope basis component only when ctx.state['file_impact_scope']=='none'","Plan Testing names a fixture 'with `file_impact_scope == \"none\"` verified only once the conditional basis component is included' and AC2 breaks verified_ratio out per generation — both depend on correctly reconstructing a scope the stated CREATE/EDIT replay cannot recover"],"finding":"The plan's material-reconstruction mechanism reconstructs file_impact by replaying CREATE/EDIT events, but file_impact / file_impact_scope / no_file_impact_reason are never carried in an EDIT's `fields` — they are written exclusively by FILE_IMPACT events, so a CREATE/EDIT-only replay recovers empty file_impact and never sets file_impact_scope=='none'.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"ffd4d95ac8484ef4c","impact":0.0,"is_primary":null,"location":"Approach, step 2 (\"replay `CREATE`/`EDIT` (tree + history-deleted) up to the sidecar timestamp for description and file_impact\")","norm_id":"n607b2c57289641be","priority":0.0,"reason":"veto:plan-goal-satisfied","recalled":false,"scenarios":["A reviewed ticket that declared file_impact via `set_file_impact` (paths) — the CREATE/EDIT-only replay recomputes with file_impact=[] and never matches the signed fingerprint, spuriously marking the row unverified.","A ticket that declared no-file-impact (`file_impact_scope=='none'`) — the conditional basis component is omitted from the recompute, so the plan's own named 'none' fixture cannot pass and AC2's per-generation breakout is understated."],"severity":"none","suggested_fix":"In step 2, split the replay: replay CREATE + EDIT `fields.description` for the description, and separately replay `FILE_IMPACT` events (LWW) up to the sidecar timestamp for file_impact/file_impact_scope/no_file_impact_reason, applying the reducer's `_file_impact_scope` derivation, before assembling PlanContext.state.","tier":"LLM","validity":0.2778,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"na","asserted_capability_confirmed":"no","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"na","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"yes","evidence_entails_finding":"no","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"no","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"no","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"insufficient"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"none","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"low","prod_impact":"none","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"none"}}},{"block_threshold":0.8,"blocking_enabled":true,"checklist_item":"","cohort":null,"criteria":["G6"],"decision":"dropped","decision_margin":-0.8,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["Plan step 2: 'replay CREATE/EDIT ... up to the sidecar timestamp for description and file_impact, ... carrying file_impact_scope / no_file_impact_reason alongside description/file_impact/children'.","src/rebar/reducer/_processors.py:399-405 `process_file_impact` sets state['file_impact'], state['file_impact_scope'], state['no_file_impact_reason'] — driven by a FILE_IMPACT event, not EDIT.","src/rebar/_commands/leaf.py:282-290 writes these fields via `append_event(resolved, 'FILE_IMPACT', data, ...)`; EDIT `fields` never carry file_impact (mine_outcome_corpus.py:258-260 `_edit_fields` reads data.fields, which are description/assignee/parent_id, not file_impact).","src/rebar/reducer/_version.py:96 lists FILE_IMPACT as a distinct KNOWN event type (folded into SNAPSHOTs during compaction, so at-review values must be recovered from FILE_IMPACT events / the nearest SNAPSHOT, not from EDIT).","material_diff.py:140,143 basis reads ctx.state.get('file_impact') and hashes file_impact_scope only when state['file_impact_scope']=='none' — both derive from FILE_IMPACT-sourced state."],"finding":"The reconstruction replays only CREATE/EDIT events, but file_impact / file_impact_scope / no_file_impact_reason are written exclusively by the separate FILE_IMPACT event type, so those material components are never rebuilt and the fingerprint recompute mismatches for any ticket with declared file impact.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f3ee8e13481aeeba2","impact":0.0,"is_primary":null,"location":"Approach step 2 ('replay CREATE/EDIT (tree + history-deleted) up to the sidecar timestamp for description and file_impact')","norm_id":"n30c01a8cdc9c4e4f","priority":0.0,"reason":"veto:plan-goal-satisfied","recalled":true,"scenarios":[],"severity":"none","suggested_fix":"In step 2, add FILE_IMPACT to the replayed event set (tree + history-deleted), applying process_file_impact's LWW semantics (paths -> scope='paths'; file_impact_scope=='none' -> scope='none' with the raw reason; else 'undeclared') to populate ctx.state before recomputing the fingerprint; for compacted tickets fall back to the nearest SNAPSHOT.compiled_state for these fields.","tier":"LLM","validity":0.2778,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"na","asserted_capability_confirmed":"no","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"na","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_cl